1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was a chief of the city of Posen (Poznan), Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.loebtree.com/kloizner.html The sister of the Maharal of Prague married Zecharia Mendle KLOIZNER the Elder of Posen.]
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son '''Binyamin Beinush KLOIZNER''' (d. 1626) married '''Sarah (or Sarka) daughter of Naftali Zvi HIRSH''' or HERTZ son of Yitzhak HaDarshan of Levuv.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benyamin and Sarka had a son Zecharia Mendle KLOIZNER (d. 1672 Jerusalem).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Source information: 
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=10138&amp;hilite=f83f4119-2e09-4141-ae51-df2cf2677384&amp;st=%d7%90%d7%a4%d7%a8%d7%99%d7%9d+%d7%a4%d7%99%d7%a9%d7%9c&amp;pgnum=255 חבל הכסף]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT R. Benyamin Beinush was the son-in-law of R. David Tevli Auerbach (son-in-law of the Maharshal).  Please see: 
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=48011&st=&pgnum=767]
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=48011&st=&pgnum=768]
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%94_%D7%9C%D7%99%D7%99%D7%91_%22%D7%94%D7%90%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%9A%22_%D7%9E%D7%A7%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A7%D7%90]
2 CONT
2 CONT R. Benyamin Beinush has been commonly confused with R. Benyamin Wolf, the son-in-law of R. Naftali Hersh Hertzkas of Lvov. R. Benyamin Beinush of Posen was '''not''' his son-in-law.
2 CONT
2 CONT .יש שכתבו אז ר' בנימין ביינוש הוא חתן ר' נפתלי צבי הירץ וזה אינו נכון
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=10138&st=%D7%91%D7%A2%D7%9C%D7%96%D7%90&pgnum=254]
2 CONT
