2 CONT
2 CONT See (in Hebrew) page 19 at:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://hebrewbooks.org/26471
2 CONT
2 CONT "Die Grabschriften des Alten Judenfriedhofes in Wien" Band I, by Dr. Bernhard Wachstein-pg. 329 (no. 429)
2 CONT
2 CONT  autor of "Atheret Zkenim"
