2 CONT Israel Jacob Munka HaLevi Horowitz's birth year had previously been entered as 1520.  However, when considering the birth years of his children, that date appears highly unlikely.  He may have been born as early as 1500, but circa
2 CONC  1510 is a reasonable estimate.  His geni profile has now been changed to reflect that.
