1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "A possible relationship between Moshe Rivkas and the Katzenellenbogen family was mentioned in Eliyahu’s Branches, the Descendants of the Vilna Gaon and His Family 13. At the time of writing of that book, evidence 
2 CONC to explain the claim was not available and so the author wrote “This claim is unsubstantiated”. New evidence makes that statement no longer appropriate."
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
