1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RESEARCH NOTE: Citing A. Landau/B. Wachstein, "Jeudische Privatbriefe aus dem Jahr 1619" (from Prague to Wien) (Wien/Liepzig 1911), Jacobi (p. Vol 2, p. 426, 15.2 and 15.2m) says that the father of the spouse of ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Moshe-Isserles-of-Cracow/329278277070007431 died in 1619 in Berestecko (Wolhinya). Jacobi goes on to say that the spouse of https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Moshe-Isserles-of-Cracow/329278277070007
2 CONC 431 ought not to be identified with the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%91%D7%99%D7%A8-%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%94%D7%A8-%D7%A8-%D7%A0%D7%A4%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%A6%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%99%D7%A8%D7%A9-%D7%A4%D7%90
2 CONC %D7%A1%D7%A1-%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A0%D7%A1-%D7%95%D7%9E%D7%A0%D7%94%D7%99%D7%92-%D7%91%D7%A7%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A7%D7%90/6000000001539054855. This is a point which needs to be checked: do Landau/Wachstein in fact say, as cited by Jacobi, t
2 CONC hat her father died in 1619 in Berestecko, and did https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%91%D7%99%D7%A8-%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%94%D7%A8-%D7%A8-%D7%A0%D7%A4%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%A6%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%99%D7%A8%D7%A9-%D7%A4%D7%90%
2 CONC D7%A1%D7%A1-%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A0%D7%A1-%D7%95%D7%9E%D7%A0%D7%94%D7%99%D7%92-%D7%91%D7%A7%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A7%D7%90/6000000001539054855 die in 1619 in Berestecko (Wolhinya)? If so then the current parentage is correct and the date of d
2 CONC eath for https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%91%D7%99%D7%A8-%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%94%D7%A8-%D7%A8-%D7%A0%D7%A4%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%A6%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%99%D7%A8%D7%A9-%D7%A4%D7%90%D7%A1%D7%A1-%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A0%D7%A1-%D7%9
2 CONC 5%D7%9E%D7%A0%D7%94%D7%99%D7%92-%D7%91%D7%A7%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A7%D7%90/6000000001539054855 should be adjusted to 1619. Otherwise, there could be an error here and she could be the spouse of: https://www.geni.com/people/Moshe-Katzin-
2 CONC of-Vilna/6000000187506410833, with the spouse of https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Moshe-Isserles-of-Cracow/329278277070007431 remaining unknown. (19 OCT 2022)
