2 CONT
2 CONT Most probably NOT Rappaport
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbiinical assessor in Frankfurt am Maine then Rabbi in Thonnhausen (Oberschwaben) iv. 5.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Moshe Hakohen Ashkenazi was born in 1550.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the husband of Nesia Katzenellenbogen  (bat Saul) and the father of Shmuel Hakohen Ashkenazi, and Ral Meir Hakohen Ashkenazi.
