2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT R' Yechiel (Yekhiel, Jehiel) LURIA rabbi of the Lithuanian city of Slutzk and an eminent Talmudist + (?) KLAUBER Father: Yitskhar Klauber Mother: (?) Shrentzels below, daughter of Eliezer Lipman Shrentzels below, son of Nakham Gra
2 CONC ndmother: Dreizel Luria, daughter of Yekhiel Luria below
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Note: Yechiel's son, Shlomo, married Francis Frances. Shlomo also marries Shpintze Katz & Lipke Haberstein. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Managed by: Mordche Zelig Mann &45 others.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: Some research on Yechiel shows possible marriage to two of Klauber’s daughters. However, both appear to have had the same childre, meaning that they are probably the same person. 
2 CONT
