1 OCCU ABD & Chief Rabbi, Talmudist, Kabalist, Philosopher, Mystisist, rabbi, Chief Rabbi of Prague, המהר"ל מפראג, Rav of Prague, Maharal MiPrague, Rabbi of Prague, Mahara"l of Prag, Chief Rabbi
