2 CONT Rabbi Shimshon (Samson) ben Betzalel Loeb (b. 1522? 1510? Prague, d. Kremitz) married the daughter of Shmuel BAK. They were the grandparents of Rav Shimshon (Samson) of Ostropolle (b. 1600, d. 1648) (author of Dan Yadin, the kabba
2 CONC list, head of Kehilat Polonnoe who died at Chmielnitzki Massacres).
2 CONT
2 CONT His child married the child of Rabbi Shabtai ben Meir Ha-Kohen (1621-1662)
