2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor of the best known branch of the S(z)tern family. Its members were among the wealthiest and most respected Frankfurt Jews. Moshe's descendants include wealthy brokers, bankers and famous rabbis. In Frankfurt, the Stern Ban
2 CONC k was a leading one. Other members of the extensive Stern family dealt in jewellery and metals, and were suppliers to the army.
