2 CONC hat her father died in 1619 in Berestecko, and did https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%91%D7%99%D7%A8-%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%94%D7%A8-%D7%A8-%D7%A0%D7%A4%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%A6%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%99%D7%A8%D7%A9-%D7%A4%D7%90%
