2 CONC alata and Pera in the capital city of Constantinople, son of his Excellency Akiva Kohen Zedek, pure Sephardi, head of the rabbinical court of Salonika, may his memory be a blessing, who was among the exiles of Spain and was accept
2 CONC ed as head of the rabbinical court of Salonika. 
