3 CONT and the clips Dr. Rosenstein sent say approximately the following (my “translation” will curl the hair of my Hebrew teacher and many other people, but it will at least help us, hopefully, to identify these people): 
3 CONT Top of the first section reads:
3 CONT
3 CONT In Krakau.  (I think this is the end of the previous paragraph).
3 CONT
3 CONT 45.  Children of hr' Israel Horwitz in the city of Prag:
3 CONT Rivke Stern wife of haGaon mvhr"r Ahron Moshe Teomim 1): Necheli (Nachele) 2), r' Jesaia Teomim 3). Children of 2: the wife of haGaon JomTov Lipman Heller, AB"D  Krakau 4). Sons of 3: haGaon Jona Teomim author of Kikajon De Jona s
3 CONC on-in-law of haGaon Meir Wahl 5). Children of 4: Moshe Heller in Prag, Shmuel Heller in Nemerov, son-in-law of Abramka Wahl, Abraham Heller in Lublin, Levi Heller in Brisk, Jehuda Leib Heller, Rachel wife of Ahron bn Koppel m'Wien
3 CONC , Nissel eshet Zev {Wolf] Slawes 6). Reisel wife of Jacob Josef hakohen rosh jeshiva b'Erisk (??) 7). Rivke wife of Zvi Hirsch m'
3 CONT
3 CONT There is a section skipped
3 CONT
3 CONT haGaon Avigdor Karo m' Wien 11). The wife of Israel Moshe Josef Norden 12).  Peretz Teomim, father of Jona Teomim. Children of 6: Natan haLevi son-in-law of Moshe K"B (Kinsburg??) AB"D Chelm. Children of 7: Jehuda haCohen father o
3 CONC f haRav Jechiel Michael haCohen z"l father of haRav Josef haCohen z"l m'Kalisch 13). Children of 8: Jona Teomim Brazinai (is this Bresnitz?), Pinchas Teomim AB"D of Vishnitz 14). HaRav Shaul Teomim Fraenkel in Mahliv (?), (avzer s
3 CONC efirot – curator of the books?? – page 440); Abraham Fraenkel, father of Isaac Fraenkel, father of Ari Loebish Teomim Fraenkel AB"D Tschertkev, father of Josef z"l Teomim AB"D Burstin, father of Zvi Hirsch Teomim of Kalisch, son-i
3 CONC n-law of haGaon mvhr"r Jacob, AB"D of Lissa 15). Children of 9: haGaon mvhr"r Ari Loeb Teomim AB"D .... 
3 CONT end of clip
