2 CONT See http://schoenblog.com/?p=1880 Who is Wolf Slawes? Correcting a very old mistake concerning the family of Rabbi YomTov Lipman Heller
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned by Tosafot Yom Tov, [http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=14284&st=&pgnum=265 beginning of third chapter of Kilayim]
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is what we had from the Notes and H-K (p.275): Wolf bn David seGal Flekeles z”l m’mishpachot Horwitz  1671  From the epitaph sent by Putik we can add (very loosely translated): On Shabbat, 8 Tishri 1671 (died) and the next da
2 CONC y, Sunday, was buried the precious and learned in Kabbala mhr”r Wolf son of mv”h David Flekeles seGal z”l m’mishpachot Horwitz.  And the rest is praise and traditional wording, but not of genealogical value.
2 CONT
