2 CONC 8881984560013524. I do not know if https://www.geni.com/people/Margola-Frankel-HALPERN/6000000009255388524 is named Margola, and I have no idea why Frankel is added to the name. See: Jacobi: Volume 4, p 94, 14.2, p. 318, 15.1m, Vo
