2 CONT According to Rosenstein & Weber in The Edelman Hoax, Eliezer Heilprin was called "Lazer Ashkenazi" in Yesh Manchilin by Pinchas Katzenellenbogen (1691-1767).
2 CONT
2 CONT While Rosenstein & Weber state that Yitzchok Eizik of Satanow was the son of Eliezer Heilprin and Margola Shor, other sources list Yitzchok Eizik and his brothers as children of Eliezer's marriage to the daughter of Natan Nata Kah
2 CONC ana.
