1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joel Ashkenazi dit Katzenellenbogen est marié à "une fille de Samuel Juda Katzenellenbogen  (1521-1597)"
2 CONT
2 CONT (Joel Ashkenazi dit Katzenellenbogen is married to "a daughter of Samuel Juda Katzenellenbogen (1521-1597)")
2 CONT
2 CONT Neil Rosenstein, The Unbroken Chain, 1990, page 5, G3.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Younger daughter of R. Samuel Judah and Abigail Katzenellenbogen married R. Joel Ashkenazi Katzenelen'''p'''ogen (with a "p") of Neustadt, son of R. Moses.  It is from R. Joel that the Katzenellen'''p'''ogens are descended.
2 CONT
2 CONT Comme Abraham, un fils de Joel, est né vers 1549, Joel n'est probablement pas né après 1529 (As Abraham, a son of Joel, was born around 1549, Joel was probably not born after 1529.)
2 CONT
2 CONT __________
