2 CONT Please one of the revising editors tell where your source for the name Shaindel comes from.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is extremely uncommon to marry a wife with the mother's name. The mother was Shaindel according to this:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=36015&st=&pgnum=602&hilite=  if you read it carefully and correctly, leading to the Margolios family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also explained there is the origin of that family name onto the Stengen tree.
