1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Jacobi Papers, p. 343, state that she was married to R' Issachar Baer Heschel-Babad as his second wife.  But this is impossible, given that he was born in 1630 and died in September 1690.  It is likely, however
2 CONC , that she was married to a much younger "Rabbi Heschel", possibly a grandson of https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Isaachar-Berish-Heschel-Babad/6000000009258502995?through=6000000065544604828.  
