2 CONC borz; their daughter became the wife of R. Arje Lobusch, who later succeeded his father-in-law in Pintschow and Neufeld (Dembitzer [H.W.] I, 82 notes)."
2 CONT
2 CONT The Jacobi Papers, p. 343:  "Haya [daughter of Yehezkel Joshua Feivel Teomim, m. Shlomo (b) Naftali-Hirsch hakohen mi-Pinczow (d. Neufeld ca. 1761; ABD Pinscov, moving in his old age to Neufeld [?]; pro-Eibenschutz; author...); co
2 CONC ntinuing:Chaya Frankel Teomim should be the mother of this person https://www.geni.com/people/Wife-of-R-Aryey-Leib-Auerbach/6000000032844604340 (who at this moment has Auerbach parents): Jacobi, Volume 4, p. 371, 10.6
