1 NAME Yitzhak /HaCohen Katz/ [of Galata]
2 GIVN Yitzhak
2 NSFX [of Galata]
2 _MARNM HaCohen Katz
1 NAME יצחק /הכהן כ״ץ ס"ט/ אב"ד גלנטה
2 GIVN יצחק
2 SURN הכהן כ״ץ ס"ט
2 NSFX אב"ד גלנטה
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 ADDR
3 ADR1  Galata Kulesi
3 STAE İstanbul
3 POST 34421
3 CTRY Turkey
1 BURI
2 DATE ABT 1500
1 OCCU Rabbi. Also lived n Istanbul, Turkey.
1 TITL Rabbi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * *****Yitzchak lived in Galata, Turkey and not Galanta, Slovakia. Any mention of Galanta is a mistake.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Yitzchak Katz, of pure Spanish ancestry, was Chief of the Rabbinical Court of Galata. One of the exiles of the Spanish and Portuguese Inquisitions, he miraculously survived along with the great Rabbi Avraham Sabbah, the grea
2 CONC t Rabbi Avraham Zacuto, and the great Rabbi Yitzchak Karo and another three Jews from the 20,000 Jews that were forcibly transported to Lisbon and forced, against their will, to apostasy. For several years he lived in Salonica wit
2 CONC h his father, and after this moved to Galata, in Constantinople, and there served as Chief of the Rabbinical Court  of the community of the exiles of Spain and Portugal until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Itzhak Ha-Cohen KATZ
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1400 in Salonika, Central Macedonia, Greece
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: in Galata
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation: Head of the rabbinic court in the city of Galata and district of Pera near the capital city of Constantinople
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Akiva (Rabbi) HaCohen KATZ b: ABT 1360 in Spain
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Spouse Unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT *Hayyim (Rabbi) KATZ b: ABT 1466 in Salonika, Central Macedonia,
2 CONT *Akiva HaGaon HaCohen KATZ of Budin b: ABT 1460 in Salonika, Central Macedonia, Greece
2 CONT *Shabtai Bar Isshai KATZ b: ABT 1463 in Salonika, Central Macedonia, Greece
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: A world apart: a memoir of Jewish life in nineteenth century Galicia. Author: Joseph Margoshes, Ira Robinson, Rebecca Margolis. Page: p. 184
2 CONT
2 CONT *********************************************
