3 CONC and 42.
2 NOTE The Great Rabbi Akiva HaKohen who was Prince in the city of Uban and afterwards moved to the city of Prague in there he rested with dignity (died) close to the year 256 (1496) and was the son of the great Rabbi Yitzchak HaKohen ch
