2 CONC ftoli LUBLINER Birth: ABT 1588 in Praha (Prague), Bohemia (Czech Republic) Death: 11 SEP 1648 in Lublin, Województwo Lubelskie (Lublin Voivodeship), Polska (Poland) Death: 1644 Death: 1650 Occupation: A.B.D. Lublin Occupation: Av 
