1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Unbroken Chain 3rd Edition: R'  Naftali Katz, on page 535, which provides the following further explanation regarding the children:
2 CONT
2 CONT "IMPORTANT: R. Naftali's first wife was the daughter of R. Isaiah Liberlish (Lieberl, who died in Prague, 1644), son of R. Isaac, Primator and Judge of Prague by whom Naftali had his children. R. Naftali's second wife was Dinah, d
2 CONC aughter of R. Judah Wahl's (Walsch), son of R. Meir Wahl's (Walsch) who married Pesia, daughter of Saul Wahl.
2 CONT
2 CONT The naming pattern of the sons only fits in with the Prague line and not the Katzenellenbogen line. Thus Naftali's son was named Isaac after Naftali's wife's father, as was a grandson (son of Perle and husband Samuel Zanwill). Thi
2 CONC s Isaac Katz named his son Isaiah, after his maternal grandfather. Conversely no Katz children were named after Judah Wahl's (Walsch) or his father Meir Walsch, which would be the case had Naftali's children been from Dinah."
2 CONT
2 CONT Chapter 5 lists the following 6 people as being children of Naftali, by his 1st wife:
2 CONT
2 CONT G7.1 Judah Katz
2 CONT G7.2 Mordecai Katz
2 CONT G7.3 Haim Katz
2 CONT G7.4 Phineas Katz
2 CONT G7.5 Perle, married R. Samuel Zanwill, son of R. Isaac of Zolkiew....
2 CONT G7.6 R. Isaac Katz....
2 CONT
2 CONT With regard to the naming logic described above, please be aware that Dinah had a Judah (her father), a Shmuel (her 2x grandfather, Maharam), a Hindeh (a 2x ggm on mother's side), and a Phineas (a 3x ggf pm mother's side). R' Naph
2 CONC tali has a Judah, a Yitzakh, a Shimshon, a Perel and a Chaim (any of which could have been named as his offspring from any spouse). We do not know much aboutthe spouse 'bat Isaiah Liberles' besides that there is a Yitzakh grandfat
2 CONC her  So strictly using naming logic, only Mordechai seems to be missing from either R' Naptali or Dinah within 6 generations.
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore, please proceed with caution as to the offspring of R' Naftali and 'bat Isaiah Liberles". These are the profiles of persons appearing as offspring of R' Naftali and bat Isaiah who are not listed in Chapter 5 (as referenc
2 CONC ed above):  https://www.geni.com/people/Hinde-Lieberman/6000000007901087305?through=6000000000071156161, https://www.geni.com/people/Judith-Katz/6000000007900783831?through=6000000000071156161, https://www.geni.com/people/R-Samson
2 CONC -HaKohen/6000000002390033539?through=6000000000071156161, https://www.geni.com/people/Shmuel-Katz/6000000017621075991?through=6000000000071156161. Other profiles involved in this situation are: https://www.geni.com/people/Rbzn-Din
2 CONC a-Katz-Heschel/6000000006712159601, https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Naftali-Hirsch-Katz-ABD-Lublin-Peirot-Genosar/6000000000071156161.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Date: 25 Sep 2022)
2 CONT
