2 CONT In 1625, Samuel was a yeshiva student at the Talmudic College of Metz, in France headed Mordecai the son of Moses Luria who was formerly ABD in Worms. He studied there until 1629 when he was called home by his father. He is the au
2 CONC thor of "Megilas Eiva" in which he writes of the experiences as known to him of his father's imprisonment and the subsequent political moves that lead to the release and re-establishment of his father's position as Av Bet Din at N
2 CONC emirov and Ludmir, and finally in Kracow.
