2 CONT Children of YOM HELLER and RACHEL ASKENAZI are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Daughter of YOM TOV (7943) HELLER. Her name is not mentioned in Lipshutz-Rosenstein but she is the common ancestor to the Collier and Unterman family of Mscibow and Svisloch. She married R. Joel of Brisk son of R. Moses GAD.
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested birthdate 1602 or later is not documented and rather unlikely
