1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Presumably not the daughter of the Megaleh Amukos, for otherwise, she would be marrying her nephew/son, since [https://www.geni.com/people/Wife-Binyomin-Zausmer/6000000008321580730?through=6000000025999322786 her h
2 CONC usband's mother] is listed on this site as the daughter of the [https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Nathan-Shapira-The-Megaleh-Amukos/367850986040012758?through=6000000008321580730 Megaleh Amukos].
2 CONT Alternatively, either this individual or her husband's mother's information is incorrect, which seems likely, since this profile's revision history makes it seem that she was initially added as the daughter of the Megaleh Amukos, 
2 CONC resulting in her and [https://www.geni.com/people/Wife-Binyomin-Zausmer/6000000008321580730?through=6000000025999322786 her mother-in-law] being sisters, and obvious impossibility. The mix-up would likely stem from confusion from 
2 CONC a misinterpretation of what is written in the introduction to [https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Samuel-Ben-Nathan-HaLevi/6000000008896390131?through=6000000035795295977 Samuel Loew]'s commentary on the talmudic tractate of Bava B
2 CONC asra, specifically the second paragraph [https://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=14852&st=&pgnum=3 here]. ([https://www.geni.com/people/Yehuda-Lowy/6000000224843427860 Yehuda Lowy], 2026)
