2 CONT 2169 • 1577-1601 (1619) • Kniha židovská bílá scan 619 http://katalog.ahmp.cz/pragapublica/permalink?xid=E1BD2EA1B72711DF820F00166F1163D4&scan=619#scan619
2 CONT
2 CONT 1053 • 1579-1585 • Kniha svědomí
2 CONT http://katalog.ahmp.cz/pragapublica/permalink?xid=E1BD2CC8B72711DF820F00166F1163D4&scan=374#scan374
2 CONT
2 CONT David Flekl a Jew bought whole building above the dry cellar including two chambers in the hall above the staircase located in his corner house next to the house of Monyš Beneš, from Anssl Kapřik a Jew and his wife Sara for the pr
2 CONC ice 200 "kop"* Czech groshen, for himself, his wife Slava, heirs and future offspring. Fully and completely paid entitles the acquisition of property, its possession and hereditary rule and will be administrated and use in way of 
2 CONC city law as Annsl Kapřil and his wife Sara did before. "Dale ___ se wedle Listuw Zidowskych zachowati maji" I am not sure with meaning and translation. Something like Furthermore this, the Letters of the Jews, they are to preserve
2 CONC  themselves Rabbi Mayer, Epsstein a senior Jew, and Chajin janitor were present at the act
2 CONT * kopa = it's unit for amount of groshen. In case of czech groshen it was 60, because approx. 250g of silver (unit called hřivna) was used for coinage of 60 czech groshens.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2169 • 1577-1601 (1619) • Kniha židovská bílá scan 694 http://katalog.ahmp.cz/pragapublica/permalink?xid=E1BD2EA1B72711DF820F00166F1163D4&scan=694#scan694
2 CONT
