1 NOTE {geni:about_me} zum roten Schild
2 CONT
2 CONT il est le père de Moïse mort en 1657,  Raphaël mort en 1686  et probablement Alcan Francfort mort en 1692 à Metz
2 CONT
2 CONT Faustini p. 329
2 CONT
2 CONT =============
2 CONT Translation to English:
2 CONT
2 CONT The name is derived from the German zum rothen Schild (with the old spelling "th"), meaning "at the red shield", in reference to the house where the family lived for many generations (in those days houses were designated not by nu
2 CONC mbers but by signs displaying different symbols or colours). A red shield can still be seen at the centre of the Rothschild coat of arms.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the father of Moïse died in 1657, Raphaël died in 1686 and probably Alcan Frankfurt died in 1692 in Metz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Faustini p.329
