1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Memorbuch of Frankfurt: May God remember the soul of Mrs Beile Bladd. On her behalf her heirs gave money to Charity. She passed away on the 4th of Tevet 398. Unna: Page 187. No 40 Bele Blad, buried Friday the 7th o
2 CONC n the new mountain , at the foot of the mountain, on the northside. The feet of the deceased opposite a double tombstone, but 8 feet away.  Horowitz: 654: Here is the women, an important and respectable lady. Her good deeds, who c
2 CONC an count them, and she did the will of her creator,  Mrs Bela, daughter of Rabbi Isaac, who died on Friday the 7th of Svat 398, which corresponds to the 22 January 1638. 
