1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This tree as it stands misses one generation.  Yehuda Leib, aka Juda Löb, married to Chawa, had 2, perhaps three sons: Simson (aka Schimson), Jekiel and Moses.  Simson, wife unknown, died in 1753 and is buried in H
2 CONC emsbach, Germany. Simson was the father of the Zacharias,1715, who married Klärle.  Simson was also the father of Hayum who married Rekla.  There were also 4daughters.
