1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 51	Shmuel bn Simon seGal Brandeis zTs”l  1627/28 (Footnote: he was grandson of the Maharal m’Prag, son of his daughter Gitele as is known from the megillah of his jichus)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Samuel BRANDEIS (d. 1628 Prague) (son of Rabbi Simon BRANDEIS and Gitele LOEW, daughter of Maharal), President of Prague Gemelnde, married his cousin the daughter of R. Chaim WAHL (Prague) and Realina (daughter of Maharal). 
2 CONC Both are grandchildren of the Maharal of Prague.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Rabbi Simon BRANDEIS (d. 1664 or 1665) married Libele PERLS (d. 1674) daughter of R. Mosche PERELS (Prague). They had 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Bezalel HaLEVI BRANDEIS SEGAL (d. 1639/40 in the plague) m. Ferkeli. One child.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gershon BRANDEIS m. Feigale. No known children.
