2 CONT [http://www.loebtree.com/tilla.html Tilla LOEW daughter of the Maharal]
2 CONT
2 CONT Tilla LOEW married Rabbi Tzvi Hirsch SABA or SABATKA of Lublin (b. Prague), Dayan of Prague 1630, son of Joseph Yaski and/or else (according to David Peter John LEWIN davidlewin at btinternet.com) she married Rabbi Zechariah Mende
2 CONC l I WAHL. (LEWIN's source: M001: in Johanna Sokolowski Mendl handwriting the Surname Wahl is added This is 1930's research in Germany and is now in the hands of the Leo Baeck Inst. in NY)
