2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Randy-Schoenberg/6000000002764082210  comment on Geni discussion [https://www.geni.com/discussions/280782?msg=1708990 Yehudit Judith Todros - No evidence for Judith Todros]: ref. https://hebrewbooks.o
2 CONC rg/pdfpager.aspx?req=6392&pgnum=1&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAAR1IN4M4cEG7UwowYQ80UZ9t45RnjNxRXOiJKOdrthegm3sWYqCtoPC4CWQ_aem_1viOLuv5wgNYQKPzt7uaMw: "'''Perel''' Wiener (with her husband Michel and his father David Chayim Wiener), '
2 CONC ''her brothers''' '''Chaim''' and '''Todros''', and '''their mother''' '''Yehudit wife of R' Elezer Todros''', are listed in "Anaf Etz Avoth" (H) by Shmuel Sanvil Kahana, Krakow 1903, page 26 (XXVI) under item 211 (resh, yod, alef
2 CONC ) as descendents of Gaon Chayim m'Worms (nephew of Maharal of Prague) - source dr. Yehuda Klausner"
