2 CONT # Judah Loew ben Bezalel called Maharal A Study on His Genealogy and Biography (pdf): https://www.academia.edu/17803222/Judah_Loew_ben_Bezalel_called_Maharal_A_Study_on_His_Genealogy_and_Biography?email_work_card=title Page 81: "1
2 CONC 58 It is worth mentioning that Meir Perels did not hold any prejudice against the descendants of '''Sinai ben Bezalel''', who had nothing to do with the Kuskes’ affair, and spoke of them with esteem. He is likely to have had a con
2 CONC fidential relation with '''Sinai’s great-grandson Hayyim Todres''', with whom he occasionally performed circumcisions, see the Library of the JTS,MS 8480, Prague Mohelbuch, fol. 4b."
