3 CONT Relevant English Translation:  My grandmother, the Rabbanit Mrs. Sarah, wife of my grandfather, the wealthy Rabbi, Moreinu HaRav Avraham Schwadron [?] the aforementioned (in letters Aleph and Bet), was the daughter of the outstand
3 CONC ing Rabbi, the famous wealthy man, Moreinu HaRav Yitzchak Katz of blessed memory from the holy community of Zolkiew, who was called by everyone R' Itzik Shimes. He was the grandson of the great and holy Kohen, the Gaon Moreinu HaR
3 CONC av Naftali Katz, Av Beit Din of the holy community of Poznan, called Rebbe Reb Naftali of blessed memory (author of the book Semichat Chachamim). And the aforementioned R' Itzik said prior to his passing that he had withstood a te
3 CONC st similar to the test of Joseph the Righteous, peace be upon him.
3 CONT
