2 CONT According to researcher ID #83831, as listed in the Family Tree of the Jewish People, Shprintze Katz married Wolf Kenina, son of Itzik Kenina, and no progeny are known.  Most authoritative sources, however, state that she married 
2 CONC Yakov HaLevi and had several children by him.
2 CONT
2 CONT The same researcher lists Abraham, Yitzchok, Aryeh Leyb and the daughter who married Efrayim Fishel Kloizner as progeny of her sister, "#1 daughter Katz," stemming from her marriage to Yakov ? [son of Yitzchok ? (d. June 7, 1685),
2 CONC  son of Abraham ?] and the daughter of Joseph Iskafa.
