2 NOTE Please note that this source (Byron Sherwin) does not mention 'HaCohen' in relation to the Fishel lineage. This is echoed in the book by Joseph Margoshes which quotes the entire grave inscription (see full citation in 'Discussion'
3 CONC ). The grave inscription does not say 'HaCohen'.
