1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacobi Papers propose father of Shmuel (https://www.geni.com/people/R-Shmuel-Schick/6000000003756394171) to be Yakov (https://www.geni.com/people/Yakov5-Schick/6000000215495288862) son of Moshe (https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/people/Moses-Schick/6000000078744435002) by Jacobi Papers (Vol 4, Page 118, 11.2). Since Jacobi has some doubts about the data, both fathers are kept on the profile pending further investigations. (15 FEB 2025)
2 CONT
2 CONT There are two explanations for the name Schick taken from each of the first letters of the words spelling "Shem Yisrael Kodesh" or "Shmuel Yuda Katzenellenbogen" - son of Rabbi Meir of Padua.
2 CONT
