1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.loebtree.com/heller.html '''The Loebtree''']: Jakob and Sarah had seven children together.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st born was  '''Dweril Duberl MIRELS FRAENKEL-HELLER''' (b. about 1580?, d. 26 Sep 1660 Vienna) married '''Dr. Ascher Amschel WALICH''' (d. 3 Aug. 1620).
2 CONT
2 CONT Remarried Rabbi '''Mose Mendel BACHARACH''' (was his second wife). (According to Wachstein, the first two marriages were in the opposite order).
2 CONT
2 CONT Remarried '''Meshullam Salman TEOMIM'''. (???? or was he her first husband and never mentioned in her file?) 
2 CONT
2 CONT The quoted birth date of 1580 seems too early, 1590 seems more logical.
