2 CONT Moses Judah Zelig Halperin, son of Eliezer Lipman of Poznań, was the great-grandson of Zevulon Eliezer, the founder of the Polish branch of the Heilprin family of Franconian origin. He served as a representative of Poznań in the C
2 CONC ouncil of Four Lands from 1669 to 1693.
